#. i18n: file adjborderwizardbase.ui line 26
#: rc.cpp:6
#, no-c-format
msgid "Welcome!"
msgstr "Benvido!"

#. i18n: file adjborderwizardbase.ui line 39
#: rc.cpp:9
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This dialog allows you to adjust your individual pad borders."
"<br>\n"
"If your pad model has uncommon dimensions, you are able to determine the custom "
"values for your pad now."
"<br>\n"
"Follow the given instructions and click <b>Next</b> to proceed."
msgstr ""
"Este diálogo permite-lle axustar as marxes individuais do touch pad."
"<br>\n"
"Se o seu modelo ten dimensións fora do normal, poderá determinar os valores "
"personalizados agora."
"<br>\n"
"Siga as instruzóns dadas e prema en <b>Seguinte</b> para continuar."

#. i18n: file adjborderwizardbase.ui line 66
#: rc.cpp:14
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adjust Left Border"
msgstr "Axustar a Marxe Esquerda"

#. i18n: file adjborderwizardbase.ui line 140
#: rc.cpp:17
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please press the left button and move along the <b>left</b> "
"border, until the <b>Next</b> Button gets enabled."
"<br>\n"
"In fact, your mouse cursor has to move."
msgstr ""
"Prema no botón esquerdo e mova-se na marxe <b>esquerda</b>, até que o botón <b>"
"Seguinte</b> sexa activado."
"<br>\n"
"O cursor do rato ten que se mover."

#. i18n: file adjborderwizardbase.ui line 150
#: rc.cpp:21
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adjust Right Border"
msgstr "Axustar a Marxe Direita"

#. i18n: file adjborderwizardbase.ui line 224
#: rc.cpp:24
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please press the left button and move along the <b>right</b> "
"border, until the <b>Next</b> Button gets enabled."
"<br>\n"
"In fact, your mouse cursor has to move."
